---@description "잡아라! 날치왕 공통 미니게임 클라이언트 계약 연결"
@Logic
script MiniGameFishingClientHandler extends Logic
	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method any CreateBehavior()
		local tBehavior = MiniGameClientBehavior()
		tBehavior.requiredCapabilities = {_MiniGameViewRegistry.CAP_STAGE, _MiniGameViewRegistry.CAP_FISHING}
		tBehavior.usesInputHub = false
		tBehavior.acceptsSelection = true
		tBehavior.openLobby = function() _MiniGameFishingPresenter:OpenLobby() end
		tBehavior.openDebugLobby = function(testMesoBalance)
			_MiniGameFishingPresenter:OpenDebugLobby()
		end
		-- 공통 클라이언트 타이머를 활성화하지 않고 서버 종료만 수신
		tBehavior.startPresentation = function(presenter, sessionId, config) return true end
		tBehavior.prepareView = function(presenter, tContext) _MiniGameFishingPresenter:BeginSession(tContext) end
		tBehavior.reset = function() _MiniGameFishingPresenter:ClearState() end
		tBehavior.endSession = function(presenter) _MiniGameFishingPresenter:EndSession() end
		tBehavior.requestRejected = function(miniGameId, reason)
			_MiniGameFishingPresenter:HandleRejected(miniGameId)
		end
		return tBehavior
	end
end
